  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICRC delegation in Bangkok provides its expertise in activities such as detention, restoring family links, helping vulnerable communities, and the promotion of international humanitarian law. We also act as a neutral intermediary, facilitating the delivery of humanitarian services.</narrative>
